{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "d1092e76ac19ea3133cf656c99e03ab9eb53fdabe6d9f839022f9606eb25e8b9", "ja": "私を、アイドルにしてもらえませんか？", "zh": "能让我成为偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a561308a6cef4aa799b2d17054376b56ae79f7f8bf1d23c9d136f68ee6a39a79", "ja": "姉に真珠星を預けてから十数年後、神宮寺は\n以前と同じ芸能事務所で働いていた。ある日\n義兄から、姉が重い病気で長くないと連絡が\n来る。再会した織姫は妹の真珠星の為「私を\nアイドルにしてもらえませんか？」と言う。", "zh": "将真珠星托付给姐姐十数年后，神宫寺\n依然在原先的演艺事务所工作。某一天，\n姐夫联系他说姐姐身患重病命不久矣。\n再次相见的织姬为了妹妹真珠星，\n提出了请求：“能把我培养成偶像吗？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "30b98d91eccfba137ecfb56a6fb77cee7bbef93eb24fa3b25e3ee12c1da76fb9", "ja": "真珠星誕生から十数年後……", "zh": "珍珠星诞生十几年后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1001_mirionpurosyatyou", "source_sha256": "d4be07a95b6a2fc48c460f68fa2943d7c4bdf747cecf47d4427dc374bd689dc9", "ja": "では、海外進出を考えている例のアイドル\nグループは君に一任したい。問題ないね？", "zh": "那么，关于进军海外的那个偶像组合，就全权交给你了。没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "64ac58354e9017892898cce3050a72d1ed08572939e6706d03dbcea5e7e0c7de", "ja": "はい、任せてください。来期の展望含めて、\nすぐにプランを作成します。", "zh": "好的，请交给我吧。包括下期的展望在内，我会马上制定计划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1003_mirionpurosyatyou", "source_sha256": "5c768957fc8caeeb22ee35bf0d19d1d57e975bb17b841d8e862e9cb96de5263b", "ja": "助かる。\n……くれぐれも無理せずに、な。", "zh": "帮大忙了。  \n……千万别勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "5fed7cbaf34eaa9d960bb427d175281399a9dc169033ef17a9caa76e64fc756e", "ja": "大丈夫です。\n何も、問題ありません。", "zh": "没关系的。\n完全没有问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "2c1ef5e37c4e2a39f8b16921f63053a03f41b70f1881129be153f8adc071ec6b", "ja": "ふう……もう月末か。そうだ、今のうちに\nお姉ちゃんの口座に送金を……あれ？", "zh": "呼……已经月底了啊。对了，趁现在赶紧给姐姐的账户汇笔钱……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "ab91e471b5a7d77d38b58d402eebea2e0c9296f6ad57e9120f8c8602b2d4e54a", "ja": "？　メール……お義兄さんから？\n珍しいな……？", "zh": "？邮件……是姐夫发来的？真少见啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1007_gianikaranomeru", "source_sha256": "deae6c9af1a021445407970287bec336a7908a58ecc0df8fd37bdca3ef602734", "ja": "「七星さん、久しぶり。実は白鳥が重い病気で、\n長いこと入院生活をしているんだ」", "zh": "“七星先生，好久不见。其实白鸟得了重病，已经住院很长时间了。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1008_gianikaranomeru", "source_sha256": "c8b91057529fbc089575cce2228a591914f15b5ce2c7f05eb3092e4cd5ef5471", "ja": "「今まで本人から口止めされていたんだけど、\nもう危ないかもしれない。なので、妹の君に……」", "zh": "「虽然之前本人一直不让我说，\n但现在可能已经有危险了。所以，我才来找身为妹妹的你……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "7679175a2ea4ffaf4bf43d27a595e4746ca7841ec607994cedad90cfea28044b", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……っ！", "zh": "姐姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1011_siratori", "source_sha256": "6a60d1f4776d514b4118d6b1ddfc5762b3017c184987dce44a443c84d5d9389c", "ja": "七星！？\n……もう、あの人でしょ。お節介なんだから。", "zh": "七星！？\n……真是的，肯定是那个人吧。就是爱多管闲事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "55454ec3e689edaf460d5dfa685dc819d3070f50488f8e0dceb906ad6ac5d4a9", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……どうして、\nこんな大事なこと黙ってたの……！？", "zh": "姐姐……为什么要把这么重要的事瞒着我……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1013_siratori", "source_sha256": "13bb54f6e38cd42873d381c91a1cafb93284d949fbc8516bf0425a72b12d1d1f", "ja": "……だって。約束、したじゃない。\n真珠星を、ちゃんと育てるって。", "zh": "……因为我们约好了。\n要好好培育珍珠星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1014_siratori", "source_sha256": "e9f1b149cea72cd40fc39d6ea489d4b7f5fff971233d63782da3c3112e82d1d7", "ja": "七星の代わりに……私が……。", "zh": "代替七星……由我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "8d9a4394e90f62a67501d43a513991f0656e4e17f2a9a6118cfc8b892d6c6b0e", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……。", "zh": "姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1016_siratori", "source_sha256": "a73257b9cbb43dd9ad01289f66572bd3234e6db19520367698529c9775fa0eb0", "ja": "……ごめんなさい、七星。真珠星が大人になるまで、\n育ててあげられそうにない。本当にごめんね……。", "zh": "……对不起，七星。在真珠星长大之前，\n我好像没办法把你养大了。真的对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "3e88680739e7ad565572f048925718d1d6123b392664fcd16554d9fc0e2f00dc", "ja": "……どうして、お姉ちゃんが謝るの……。", "zh": "……为什么姐姐要道歉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "08bb2415e2a84118d5845a099074ab10a7c86ddbcbc9160e85056827a9401388", "ja": "お姉ちゃんが謝ることなんて、何もない！\n私のほうこそ、頼ってばかりでごめんなさい……。", "zh": "姐姐根本没有什么需要道歉的！  \n该道歉的是我才对，总是依赖你，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1019_siratori", "source_sha256": "b99d155aa406395bc4cf2162f4aa2b2927fb1466a03fdc1fb448b6cfee18e766", "ja": "それこそ、気にする必要なんかない。\n私は、七星のお姉ちゃんだもの。", "zh": "正因为如此，才没必要在意。\n我可是七星的姐姐嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1020_siratori", "source_sha256": "878c5c696837b1a60afc5a89706c64cf0d9d0e7483014b31afd592578bd01283", "ja": "真珠星のために、お金だって送ってくれてるじゃない。\nありがたく貯めさせてもらってるんだから。", "zh": "你不是连钱都寄来给真珠星了吗。承蒙你的好意，我就心怀感激地帮你攒着啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "c058897b14c224979612502c4e2dda39457b1f4bd94e5a00ac7a592959674146", "ja": "……じゃあそれは、お姉ちゃんの治療費に使って。", "zh": "……那就把那个用在姐姐的治疗费上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "d690acf07bae675be43b07ce54de4dec553443140de1e9f2980ad92e236163b9", "ja": "真珠星や織姫のことは、私に任せてくれていいから。\nお姉ちゃんは治療に専念して。", "zh": "真珠星和织姬就交给我吧。\n姐姐专心治疗就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1023_siratori", "source_sha256": "fdd6580d3b6a1d5ddd8204b8ecba6d38ee3b31d36fbfb47c59ffa0cadfc21e80", "ja": "七星……真珠星に会う気になったの？", "zh": "七星……你打算去见真珠星了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "9c96f9cbe50f67dccc9db088974a3e67253acfd9270106e762089691724764ef", "ja": "そうじゃないけど……方法なら、あるもの。", "zh": "虽然不是那样……但办法还是有的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "70ebe03d00acff81cef4e2883498e9b2200f293eabbcb1849b75c28adcbd1e7a", "ja": "お疲れさまでした～！\nふう、今日もバイト頑張ったな～……ん？", "zh": "辛苦啦～！\n呼，今天打工也努力过头了呢～……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "33196a6be167b9215cd4cc975fa688d506a19b086a1128eeddecedeb83d7d421", "ja": "……久しぶり、織姫。\n私のこと、覚えてるかな。", "zh": "……好久不见，织姬。\n还记得我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "277de017d6a6466d6f5108dd92f3fdba51285d81de5c3a23cbfa42bc0c1b5f11", "ja": "！　七星叔母さん、ですよね……？\nお母さんの妹の……！", "zh": "！是七星阿姨，对吧……？\n妈妈的妹妹……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "83b8a24afe0709858905394ecff12ee84d6a81428eff6d90816e29b650b1f938", "ja": "覚えててくれたんだ……よかった。\nちょっとだけ、時間ある？", "zh": "你还记得我……太好了。能耽误你一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "5cd158c8443034643c113d1da19afa59c56176998c911b2d351cecd82be493d8", "ja": "お義兄さん……お父さんから聞いたよ。\nお母さんが病気で、大変だって……。", "zh": "姐夫……我听爸爸说了。你妈妈生病了，日子过得很辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1030_052kao", "source_sha256": "1868e01cad66d1231f4d7434903ad33ab2d08773a2bc873cf9beec9c885309f2", "ja": "織姫が、家のためにバイトを掛け持ちしてるって\n聞いた。私も援助するし、生活費の足しに使って。", "zh": "听说织姬为了家里，同时打着好几份工。我也会帮忙的，就拿去补贴生活费吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1031_040tam", "source_sha256": "c67be1e1a05de5a593a24fed9713c5bb334f9b7a42c169a811e30c221081b987", "ja": "わあ、助かります。\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇，那真是帮大忙了。\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "d5664062be23a25c73784cabca088ced54ac2382d3987dc966fe735d88d9dd50", "ja": "……あのっ！　お金もありがたいんですけど、\n実は、お願いがあって……。", "zh": "……那个！虽然给钱我也很感激，\n但其实，我有个请求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "c25aac835754e5be8594faa6e6c93363cccb81649610502995a768825527a32e", "ja": "お願い……？", "zh": "拜托我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1034_040tam", "source_sha256": "004b7ca3f8195ec18c337f0675c1637e6d6516c6bf51d7f7cfcd2ed8ab0f453f", "ja": "お母さんから聞いたことあるんです。\n叔母さんは、アイドル事務所でお仕事してるって。", "zh": "我听妈妈说过。\n她说，阿姨在偶像事务所工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "d1092e76ac19ea3133cf656c99e03ab9eb53fdabe6d9f839022f9606eb25e8b9", "ja": "私を、アイドルにしてもらえませんか？", "zh": "能让我成为偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1036_052kao", "source_sha256": "0fef5152149bec46152cd4d486b53738d95e0b41e452e45d62e49c3b5d9691fd", "ja": "織姫を、アイドルに……？", "zh": "让织姬当偶像……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1037_040tam", "source_sha256": "4ec44c5cd2dd78d1a2083fec05fdeee3e3cacc379297c5b6e12493654ca2ad66", "ja": "はい！　妹は……真珠星は小さいころ、\nアイドルが好きだったんです。", "zh": "是的！妹妹……真珠星小时候，很喜欢偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1038_040tam", "source_sha256": "e832c1b32e5185926fadfd4a94b4146dacd71ef99b9f3fc27e77c84b8a0bb808", "ja": "「あのね、アイドルはみてる人を\n元気にするんだよ。すごいよね」って。", "zh": "“她说，‘偶像能让看着他们的人\n打起精神来哦。好厉害呀’。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1039_052kao", "source_sha256": "a3c36a027916473593a9ba09f5dc272cb61468ab65de4b7899669c653dbb620f", "ja": "そんなことを……。", "zh": "居然会说那种话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1040_040tam", "source_sha256": "9288437ba242d66ca834f53fc9edb459ea0b63c8690eda62fd53542ca2ad1b92", "ja": "小さいころは、「アイドルになりたい」って\n言ってたんです。でも、お母さんが病気になって……。", "zh": "小时候她曾经说过「想成为偶像」。\n但是，妈妈生病之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1042_040tam", "source_sha256": "527f5303e35c69546a99399a8ac3b49df20ab71366854079e59e1bd8f0dcd239", "ja": "そのせいか、今はお医者さん目指してるみたいで。\n勉強ばっかりして、いつも難しい顔してるから……。", "zh": "也许就是因为这个，现在她好像在以当医生为目标。\n她总是一个劲儿地学习，老是愁眉苦脸的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1043_040tam", "source_sha256": "a11749beb581d1f2748867018f278418188703b4f304602805330eb4a9c9b8a4", "ja": "私、何かできることないかなって考えてたんですけど。\nアイドルなら、真珠星を元気にできるかもって！", "zh": "我就在想，有没有什么我能做的。\n要是成为偶像的话，说不定能让真珠星振作起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1044_040tam", "source_sha256": "87fc1c62d805ee8b88543c1f792c7a52c93ed5de011a570d0d11d627ba05eb0d", "ja": "それに、私がアイドルになれたら、真珠星だって\n「自分もなれるかも？」って、また思うかもだし！", "zh": "而且，如果我能成为偶像，真珠星也可能会再次觉得“自己说不定也能做到吧？”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1046_040tam", "source_sha256": "bdcfee5e4e9bca1816d1e27c4785a9295ce623bd76be83faa130fe8fe40ec9c5", "ja": "私、なんでもします！\n真珠星を、元気にしたいんです！", "zh": "我什么都愿意做！\n我想让真珠星重新振作起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "8b274749b5ed220e2ac693424d60bf1e632daeb7e560c3103c5efcffd5ceba23", "ja": "なんでも……。", "zh": "无论什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1048_040tam", "source_sha256": "807467320df127a8459030448fa27de721f2a02bac19e3d425e3f657a45c00dd", "ja": "はい！！", "zh": "好的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1049_052kao", "source_sha256": "7cc67f1dfa84f4d9084f6801dec4e30b4054e42b3169c979edcffc935047499f", "ja": "（性格的に優しくて、他人が望む事に100%\n応えようとする。奉仕精神の塊みたいな子……）", "zh": "（她性格温柔，总想要100%回应他人的愿望。简直就像是服务精神的化身……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1050_052kao", "source_sha256": "097b91361915c1fde61ac1accf09d3dc3957dadbb67128861b51ba6213d56797", "ja": "（その分、自我が薄いようだけど……サービス精神\n旺盛なところは、ある意味アイドルに向いているわ）", "zh": "（不过，相应地，她的自我意识似乎很淡薄……但她那旺盛的服务精神，从某种意义上来说，确实很适合成为偶像）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1051_052kao", "source_sha256": "f693033d79a4796e7bbce0215baad9fcaf30b39c2246b0da6d27b94f90019d25", "ja": "（危うい反面、天性のアイドル向きとも言える。\nそしてこのビジュアル……）", "zh": "（虽然有些危险，但也可以说是天生适合当偶像。还有这副外表……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1052_040tam", "source_sha256": "ee067392a69a46772368223a9846e12e821b1bb3f0a32787ab4ec74a9d59d0b8", "ja": "あ、あのー……？", "zh": "啊，那个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1053_052kao", "source_sha256": "8d9beda5eb087defb71261e33501ae91188f7c89c2873e379083c366ea3117c6", "ja": "（……皮肉ね。日本も海外も飛び回ってきたのに、\nこんな身近に、ダイヤの原石が眠っていたなんて）", "zh": "（……真讽刺啊。明明都已经飞遍日本和海外了，\n没想到这么近的地方，竟然沉睡着一颗未经雕琢的钻石）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1054_040tam", "source_sha256": "2b8fa001091732585f38b2097080b2e568b273ede31297eb7ba739db270bf35d", "ja": "やっぱり、ダメですかね？\nそ、そうですよね、突然こんなお願い……。", "zh": "果然还是不行吗？\n说、说得也是，突然提出这样的请求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1055_052kao", "source_sha256": "404661c74d4cbac5a5c7cae757f11ca9f20be2fd294bd06fed3ac84c5749fd8d", "ja": "採用よ。\nスカウトという形で構わないわね。", "zh": "录用你了。\n以挖掘新人的形式，可以吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1056_040tam", "source_sha256": "b922e8159622f2449479b90e4de5998111c793b4de03fab1c91852b4182e0217", "ja": "え……ええっ！？\nそ、それじゃあ……！", "zh": "诶……诶！？  \n那、那就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1057_052kao", "source_sha256": "071515b442b1fc793a4419f40b14b4215bb305944151e735fb107ca935b41698", "ja": "面倒を避けるために、血縁であることは\n社長以外には秘密にしましょう。", "zh": "为了避免麻烦，我们就把彼此有血缘关系这件事，\n对社长以外的人保密吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1058_052kao", "source_sha256": "adaa6fe004bae4cf971bd97336802a520c55e41860fa75c62d46a28cbbc4e3ee", "ja": "デビューまでの一切は任せなさい。あなたなら\nきっと、トップアイドルにだってなれるわ。", "zh": "出道前的一切都交给我吧。凭你的能力，一定能成为顶尖偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_05_1059_040tam", "source_sha256": "7d675fe19aaadd8006f534f01f8367c5b2a6ce3adc3320c7b1bf6ec595848ea6", "ja": "……！\nよ、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "……！\n请、请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
